{"id":"reference/Single-Threaded-Builds","kind":"langref","title":"单线程构建","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/#Single-Threaded-Builds","file":"reference/Single-Threaded-Builds.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"Single-Threaded-Builds","text":"单线程构建"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"Single-Threaded-Builds\" class=\"chapter-anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Single-Threaded-Builds/#Single-Threaded-Builds\">单线程构建</a></h2>\n\n      <p>Zig 的编译选项 <kbd>-fsingle-threaded</kbd> 具有以下效果：</p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>所有<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Variables/#Thread-Local-Variables\">线程局部变量</a>均视为普通的<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Variables/#Namespace-Level-Variables\">命名空间级变量</a>。</li>\n        <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Async-Functions/#Async-Functions\">异步函数</a>的开销变为与普通函数调用相同。</li>\n        <li><code><span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"builtin\"</span>).single_threaded</code> 变为 <code><span class=\"tok-null\">true</span></code>，使得读取该变量的用户态接口更高效。例如，<code>std.Mutex</code> 变为空数据结构，其全部函数均不执行操作。</li>\n      </ul>\n      \n\n      ","translation":{"total":5,"translated":5}}
